  33:     - Each teal object encloses one to four 4-connected black regions inside its bbox.
  34: 
  35:     Rule
  36:     - Count the enclosed black regions for each teal object.
  37:     - Recolor the object's pixels: one hole -> blue, two holes -> green, three holes -> red, four holes -> yellow.
  38:     - Leave the black background unchanged.
  39: 
  40:     Key insight
  41:     - The varied object shapes and sizes are distractions; the color class is determined by topological hole count.
